    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970422.0152\n\nBONN, April 22 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT German growth of 2.25-2.75 percent seen in 1997-98\n\n\n\n\nThe German economy will grow by 2.25 percent in 1997 and 2.75 percent next year, the country's six leading economic institutes said in their spring report published Tuesday.\n\nThe institutes' prediction is in line with government estimates.\n\nGermany's gross domestic product (GDP) grew by 1.4 percent in 1996.",
